<p>
  Diabetes Wrapped connects to your Nightscout server and lets you see cool stats about your year as a diabetic.
  If you have insulin delivery information in Nightscout, you'll see insulin use stats in addition to CGM stats.
</p>

<% if user_signed_in? %>
  <%= link_to "View your report", report_path(slug: current_user.report.slug), class: "cta-button" %>
<% else %>
  <%= link_to "Get Started →", new_user_path, class: "cta-button" %>
<% end %>

<div class="screenshots">
  <img src="/screenshot.png"
    alt="Cropped screen shot of Diabetes Wrapped report.">
  <img src="/screenshot-2.png"
    alt="Cropped screen shot of Diabetes Wrapped report.">
</div>

<h3>What does it include?</h3>
<p>
  <ul>
    <li>Total units of insulin used.</li>
    <li>Average time in range across the year.</li>
    <li>Estimate of how many times your CGM woke you up.</li>
    <li>Monthly breakdown of stats.</li>
    <li>...and more!</li>
  </ul>
</p>

<h3>Privacy</h3>
<p>
  <ul>
    <li>Diabetes Wrapped <b>does not</b> sell or share your data.</li>
    <li>
      Your report will be accessible via a public URL, which you can choose to share with friends or family.
      The public page does not include any personal information (email, etc).
    </li>
    <li>You can download a CSV of the raw data used to calculate your report once it is finished.</li>
    <li>The data on diabeteswrapped.com will be permanently deleted in February 2027.</li>
  </ul>
</p>

<h3>Disclaimer</h3>
<p>
  Diabetes Wrapped is meant for entertainment purposes only and should not be used to make treatment decisions!
</p>
